@startuml c4-code-heating-command-sequence
title Code: последовательность — пользователь включает отопление

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Identity Service" as Id
participant "Heating Service" as Heat
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Device Gateway" as DeviceGateway
participant "Новое реле\nотопления" as Device
participant "Старое реле\nотопления" as LegacyDevice

User -> Web: Включить отопление
Web -> GW: POST /heating/{homeId}/on
GW -> Id: Проверить JWT и доступ к дому
Id --> GW: OK (authorized)
GW -> Heat: POST /api/v1/heating/on
Heat -> Heat: Command Handler + State Manager\n(desired = ON)
Heat -> MQTT: publish commands/heating/{deviceId}\n{commandId, action: ON}
Heat --> GW: 202 Accepted
GW --> Web: 202 Accepted

MQTT -> DeviceGateway: commands/heating/{deviceId}
DeviceGateway -> DeviceGateway: Command Dispatcher\n+ Protocol Adapter
alt Устройство уже поддерживает MQTT
    DeviceGateway -> MQTT: publish devices/{id}/commands
    MQTT -> Device: Команда ON
    Device --> MQTT: ack + state=ON
    MQTT -> DeviceGateway: ack
else Старое устройство в период миграции
    DeviceGateway -> LegacyDevice: Синхронная команда ON
    LegacyDevice --> DeviceGateway: state=ON
end
DeviceGateway -> MQTT: publish events/device/{deviceId}/ack\n{commandId, state: ON}
MQTT -> Heat: events/device/{deviceId}/ack
Heat -> Heat: State Manager\n(actual = ON)

Web -> GW: GET /heating/{homeId}/status
GW -> Heat: статус
Heat --> GW: state=ON
GW --> Web: state=ON
Web --> User: Отопление включено

@enduml
